              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Crossbowmen have a hand weapon and light crossbow. Light Cavalry. Feigned Flight. All Andalusian cavalry other than lancers may change from skirmish to open order formation or from open order to skirmish using a Reform move.</characteristic>
